078 - For God So Loved Us
 / 
Key: D
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 78
Topic: God the Father - 

Verse 1:
[D]For God so loved us,
[D]He [Bm]sent the [G]Savior:
[D]For God so [A7/E]loved us,
[A7]and loves me too.

Refrain:
[D]Love so [A7/E]unending!
[A7]I'll sing His [D]praises,
[A7/E]God loves His children,
[D]loves even me.

Verse 2:
[D]He sent the Savior,
[D]the [Bm]blest Redeemer;
[D]He sent the [A7/E]Savior
[A7]to set me free.

Verse 3:
[D]He bade me welcome,
[D]O [Bm]word of [G]mercy;
[D]He bade me [A7/E]welcome,
[A7]O voice divine.

Verse 4:
[D]Glory and honor,
[D]O [Bm]Love eternal,
[D]To Him be [A7/E]given
[A7]while life shall last.
